'''AAO: Avatar Optimizer''' is an [[Avatar]] optimization tool, built on [[Community:NDMF|NDMF]].

== History ==

The project's official anniversary post summarizes much of its early history<ref name="first-anniversary-blog-post">https://vpm.anatawa12.com/avatar-optimizer/ja/posts/2024-06-27-one-year-since-stable-release/</ref>.

* AAO is also known as "Anatawa12's Avatar Optimizer", but was renamed in later release<ref name="first-anniversary-blog-post" />.
* The initial release was not based on NDMF<ref>https://github.com/anatawa12/AvatarOptimizer/issues/353</ref>. However, later version migrated to the NDMF<ref>https://github.com/anatawa12/AvatarOptimizer/pull/375</ref>.

== Features ==
